    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d152-a18">

                <pb facs="0559" n="437" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg437"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 18, in No. 1049.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Atwood to Mr. Allen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Custom-House</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Shelburne, Nova
                                Scotia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-10-05"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 5,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to notify you that the ship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bridgewater</hi> is still under seizure and a clearance
                    will not be granted until the terms of decision are complied with, and that any
                    attempt to move her without clearance is under the law a felony.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Atwood</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Collector.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
